{"v":4,"catch":"大正帝都的怪奇偵探傳，正式復活","desc":"那個《惡魔召喚師 葛葉雷道 對 超力兵團》經過大幅升級各項元素後，終於推出Remaster版了！\n\n大正二十年，帝都。\n「請你殺了我。」\n一名女學生留下這句話後，便被惡魔帶走而下落不明。整個事態最後將會發展成震撼帝都全境的大災難。\n葛葉雷道表面上是實習偵探，但實際上是守護帝都的惡魔召喚師。在追查女學生下落的時候，卻找到了隱藏在事件背後的意外真相。\n\n化身為守護帝都的英雄葛葉雷道，運用惡魔之力解開謎題、遊玩爽快的戰鬥祓除邪惡吧！","publisher":"SEGA","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 13.0GB / Switch 13.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6b16bfbeeb89095b6a02ce927f363f29405ef20b409456b0241418eaf3a369b4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/be4833b16800a281ca83b678e80c0250f078d5fed376fe453f105d517a461085.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2fb75919937f9eec4753a9fd68fc9458f2a8a8cc2244996fbb74623b3de2dcf6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69152a3d44ca3a80bb2573eeedfab2d49c126990a424e28aef14029514fba4c5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b6f759b87deb6fb1af3af3fa71371e6053168af8bfc6c7c499bbfcd07caace29.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/56908cf83a9dd232d6b2527f32c7a3f7f2a96074b47f0490f4b21965e70d6e51.jpg"],"titleId":"01001e001ad98000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000055223","name":"和惡魔返鄉的男人全集","img":"e995ef5f1080b3222495e8bc87d0820e2b4dbbd3d6da4173710bf258922f1a73","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000055224","name":"石榴之鬼","img":"bb9382969de8f0e71c1a536737be0ff8dd43dfbc2b79438387987c026507c88e","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000055225","name":"SMT惡魔特選＋α","img":"8ed9f740efd2a584dd52c303c4405613a5b21995abe6c50ec9207894738f037b","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000055229","name":"配給品・特技書組合","img":"3f46310a595e3088bfb142cac195407704ee7e80f89a70e50cecefa95ef58bfb","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000055230","name":"配給品・必攜道具組合","img":"7403d6328981d6a9aa1e2f7f630a2349b573224db2eebb18dd31f6c85aedb57c","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000055226","name":"授予新的稱號給你吧","img":"0700b4ee5c20678197bc310e342b8cd3719026